              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Larkin Powell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added two cups of cubed apples to the rhubarb and kept the batter the same. I poured it into a Chicago style pizza stone pan and it worked pretty slick. I also out in a couple teaspoons of chopped walnuts. it is not overly sweet which was good for diet. Pretty quick and easy.",
